data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" not let it go out.'\", \"w02\": \"凌晨四点的城市沉入一天中最深沉的静"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"谧。路灯在泛着湿气的柏油路面上拉出昏黄而漫长的倒影，喧嚣早已退场"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"，只余下远方高架桥上偶尔疾驰而过的货车胎噪。环卫工人的"}}

